<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">
  <title>服务已终止</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: #0f0f11;
      color: #f0f0f5;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .wrapper {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 2rem;
      max-width: 520px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
    }
    p {
      margin: 0.75rem 0;
      color: #a1a1aa;
    }
    .divider {
      width: 48px;
      height: 2px;
      background: #52525b;
      margin: 1.5rem auto;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrapper">
    <h1>服务已终止</h1>
    <p>本网站已停止运营，感谢你的理解与支持。</p>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <p>Service terminated. Thank you for your understanding.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
